## Interview Tip

Top 1 Employee Per Department:

```sql
WHERE salary_rank = 1;
```

Top 3 Employees Per Department:

```sql
WHERE salary_rank <= 3;
```

Top 5 Employees Per Department:

```sql
WHERE salary_rank <= 5;
```

This is one of the most common Window Function interview patterns.

## Why Use DENSE_RANK()?

Example:

| Salary |
|---------|
| 95000 |
| 95000 |
| 90000 |
| 85000 |

DENSE_RANK():

```text
1
1
2
3
```

Employees with the same salary receive the same rank.

No ranks are skipped.

